# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in. Never commit .dev.vars.
#
# For a deploy these are secrets/vars set with wrangler, not this file:
#   wrangler secret put PRIVATE_KEY --env production

# The keeper EOA. Generate a fresh one — `cast wallet new` — and never reuse a
# key from anywhere else, this file included. It only pays gas: it never holds
# or moves BZZ and needs no authorization on the registry, so fund it with
# xDAI (Gnosis) or test ETH (Sepolia) and nothing else.
PRIVATE_KEY="0x<64 hex chars>"

# Required. This worker ships no endpoints of its own — bring a reliable one.
# Comma-separate several to fail over between them, tried in order.
RPC_URL="https://..."

# --- everything below is optional ---

# Maintain only these volumes instead of the whole registry.
# VOLUME_IDS="0x...,0x..."

# Simulate without sending anything. Good for validating a new deployment.
# DRY_RUN="true"

# Log a warning when the keeper EOA's balance drops below this (wei).
# MIN_BALANCE_WEI="100000000000000000"

# Batching limits. Defaults: 50 ids per tx, 8 txs per cycle, 100 per read page.
# MAX_IDS_PER_TX="50"
# MAX_TX_PER_CYCLE="8"
# PAGE_SIZE="100"
